An array literal closed with `)` instead of `}`: mismatched_delimiter on
the `)`, naming the expected closer. The `{` is popped, so nothing
cascades into unclosed_delimiter (diag.mismatched_delimiter).
-- input.ssl --
:PROCEDURE DefaultUnits;
	:DECLARE aUnits;
	aUnits := {"mg", "g", "kg");
	:RETURN aUnits;
:ENDPROC;
